    {
      "text": "first parents of Coriantumr2 came from tower, Omni 1:22 (Hel. 6:28; Ether 1:33). Benjamin has tower erected, Mosiah 2:7. Noah3 builds high tower to watch Lamanites, Mosiah 11:12–13. from tower Limhi discovers Lamanites’ preparations for war, Mosiah 20:8. plates of gold give account of Jaredites back to building of tower, Mosiah 28:17 (Ether 1:5). Moroni1 builds towers as part of fortifications, Alma 50:4. devil put it into men’s hearts to build tower high enough to reach heaven, Hel. 6:28. Nephi2 prays upon tower, Hel. 7:10–11.",
